.TH TIMEVAL_TO_TIMESPEC 3 2025\-05\-17 "Linux man\-pages (未リリース)" 
.SH 名前
TIMEVAL_TO_TIMESPEC, TIMESPEC_TO_TIMEVAL \- convert between time structures
.SH 書式
.nf
\fB#define _GNU_SOURCE\fP
\fB#include <sys/time.h>\fP
.P
\fBvoid TIMEVAL_TO_TIMESPEC(const struct timeval *\fP\fItv\fP\fB, struct timespec *\fP\fIts\fP\fB);\fP
\fBvoid TIMESPEC_TO_TIMEVAL(struct timeval *\fP\fItv\fP\fB, const struct timespec *\fP\fIts\fP\fB);\fP
.fi
.SH 説明
These macros convert from a \fBtimeval\fP(3type)  to a \fBtimespec\fP(3type)
structure, and vice versa, respectively.
.P
This is especially useful for writing interfaces that receive a type, but
are implemented with calls to functions that receive the other one.
.SH 標準規格
